---
import { SITE } from '@/data/site';
---

<section class="section bg-black" aria-label="About Sunil">
  <div class="container mx-auto">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">

      <!-- Text -->
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Who is the_reptitan?</p>
        <h2 class="headline text-4xl sm:text-5xl">
          {SITE.coach}
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-stone">
          <p>I'm Sunil Khadka. I hold the Guinness World Record for clap pull-ups, set on June 21, 2025.</p>
          <p>But I didn't start there. I started with four sloppy reps on a college football goalpost, knees bending, body swinging. No gym background, no head start. Just a bar and the decision to keep showing up.</p>
          <p>I believe will power and mindset matter more than where you come from. That's the whole reason I set the record, and it's the reason I coach now. If I could close the gap from four reps to a world record, you can close the gap from where you're stuck.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href={SITE.instagram}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-mono text-sm text-sand transition-colors hover:text-sand-dim"
          >
            @the_reptitan ↗
          </a>
          <a
            href={SITE.personalSite}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-mono text-sm text-stone transition-colors hover:text-sand"
          >
            sunil-khadka.com.np ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Photo placeholder -->
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black aspect-[4/3] sm:aspect-[3/4] max-w-sm">
        <img
          src="/sunil-hero.jpg"
          alt={SITE.coach}
          class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top opacity-80"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          onerror="this.parentElement.style.display='none'"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
